# Figure 4 of Zhang et al., Efficient Subcubic Alias Analysis for C (2014).
# a = assignment; d = dereference; reverse edges are explicit.
# b = a; c = &b; *d = *c; *c = e;
&b b d
b &b dbar
&c c d
c &c dbar
&d d d
d &d dbar
c *c d
*c c dbar
d *d d
*d d dbar
a b a
b a abar
&b c a
c &b abar
*c *d a
*d *c abar
e *c a
*c e abar
